Dont forget to make your secrets.h in this folder, heres a shell of what it should look like
#pragma once
#define SECRET_WIFI_SSID ""
#define SECRET_WIFI_PASS ""
#define SECRET_DEVICE_NAME ""
#define SECRET_HOST_ADDRESS ""
#define SECRET_HOST_PORT 443

// Optional token. Leave empty unless the backend starts enforcing one.
#define SECRET_DEVICE_TOKEN ""

Non-secret device settings, including WSS_PATH, timezone, pins, send intervals,
and camera defaults, live in config.h.
